{"message":{"html":"<div class=\"modal-layer\" role=\"dialog\" aria-modal=\"true\" aria-label=\"We’re making interactive 3D maps for malls, markets, festivals, exhibitions and cities.\"><button class=\"modal-backdrop\" aria-label=\"Close\" tabindex=\"-1\"></button><div class=\"modal about-modal\"><div class=\"modal-head\"><strong>We’re making interactive 3D maps for <span class=\"flip-word\"><span class=\"sr-only\">malls, markets, festivals, exhibitions, cities.</span><span class=\"flip-word-current\" aria-hidden=\"true\">malls.</span></span></strong><button class=\"icon-button\" aria-label=\"Close\"><svg/></button></div><p class=\"modal-body\">Jalan GMBB is still an experiment. Most of the information here is gathered from public sources and hasn’t been manually verified, so some things may be inaccurate or outdated.</p><p class=\"modal-body\">We’re exploring a new way to discover the places around us. Instead of another list or directory, we want to make exploring places more visual, interactive and fun.</p><p class=\"modal-body\">Let us know if…</p><ul class=\"about-list\"><li>you find this interesting or useful.</li><li>you want something like this for your place.</li><li>you spot anything inaccurate, outdated, or missing.</li><li>you have an idea for what we should build next.</li></ul><p class=\"modal-body\">We’d love to hear from you.</p><div class=\"modal-actions\"><a class=\"primary-button\" href=\"https://shadowcraft.notion.site/3daa02de993f8085b6d3ed17b6d3be5a?pvs=105\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Get in touch</a></div></div></div>","boxes":[{"cls":"modal-layer","tag":"div","text":"","box":"0,0,1440,876","font":"400 16px/24px Nunito","color":"rgb(12, 13, 15)","bg":"rgba(0, 0, 0, 0)","pad":"20px","radius":"0px"},{"cls":"modal-backdrop","tag":"button","text":"","box":"0,0,1440,876","font":"400 16px/24px Nunito","color":"rgb(12, 13, 15)","bg":"rgba(16, 19, 23, 0.333)","pad":"0px","radius":"0px"},{"cls":"modal about-modal","tag":"div","text"